{"availability":"available","full":"reearth/ygo","name":"ygo","description":"A pure-Go, production-grade implementation of Yjs. Runs real collaborative apps: a horizontally-scaling, Hocuspocus-compatible websocket server with versioned persistence and compaction. Hardened by differential fuzzing and a byte-level conformance suite. Also embeddable on iOS/Android via gomobile.","category":"Other","language":"Go","stars":61,"forks":16,"created":"2025-04-02T10:30:37Z","updated":"2026-10-11T06:25:08Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ygo-collab-notes.onrender.com/","topics":["android","collaborative-editing","crdt","distributed-systems","go","golang","gomobile","hocuspocus","ios","local-first","local-first-software","real-time","realtime","sync","websocket","yjs"],"demo":"https://ygo-collab-notes.onrender.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.721Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.721Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.721Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.721Z","stars":61,"forks":16}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( []( []( []( [](go.mod) [](#compatibility) [](LICENSE)","ygo is a pure-Go implementation of Yjs, the CRDT (Conflict-free Replicated Data Type) framework for real-time collaborative editing. Use it to build collaborative applications in Go — shared text, rich text, maps, arrays, and XML trees that merge concurrent edits without conflicts, without a central authority, and without operational transformation.","ygo is binary-compatible with the JavaScript Yjs reference implementation: it speaks both the V1 and V2 update wire formats byte-for-byte, along with the y-protocols sync handshake and awareness layer. Updates produced by ygo apply cleanly in Yjs (JavaScript) and yrs (Rust), and vice versa. That claim is enforced, not asserted — a byte-level cross-language conformance suite generated from yjs@13.6.30 and a differential convergence fuzzer both run in CI."],"features":["Pure Go — no CGO, no V8, no embedded JavaScript engine, on every target including iOS and Android.","Binary-compatible with Yjs and yrs — both update wire formats (V1 and V2, with V1↔V2 conversion). Verified byte-for-byte in CI against fixtures generated from yjs@13.6.30, plus a differential convergence fuzzer.","Every Y-type — YText, YArray, YMap, YXmlFragment, YXmlElement, YXmlText, with snapshots, garbage collection, and an undo manager.","The y-protocols layer — the SyncStep1/SyncStep2/incremental-update handshake, and awareness for presence and cursors.","Transport-agnostic core — the CRDT has no transport dependency; the WebSocket and HTTP bindings are addons."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/reearth/ygo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f838ae1f968bb168a47c3c491fc3d6cc266cedc9054d1aa6cd788d75026a795c","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.819Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.819Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( []( []( []( [](go.mod) [](#compatibility) [](LICENSE)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/reearth/ygo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f838ae1f968bb168a47c3c491fc3d6cc266cedc9054d1aa6cd788d75026a795c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/reearth/ygo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.820Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T06:25:08Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/reearth/ygo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.822Z","hash":"f838ae1f968bb168a47c3c491fc3d6cc266cedc9054d1aa6cd788d75026a795c","originalBytes":43167,"storedBytes":43167,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","doc","ygo","yjs","server","run","examples","see","sync","websocket","update","func","persistence","crdt","mobile","transact","awareness","both","err","room","client","default","document","peer","via","wire","store","after","benchmark","javascript","nil","peers","same","when","cluster","comparison","hands